{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The prior approval notification received 27/09/2024 is acknowledged. It is considered that the proposed erection of a 20m monopole, supporting six antennas and one 300mm dish with three equipment cabinets at ground level and ancillary works, is contrary to the provisions of Schedule 2 Part 16 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (As Amended) as the siting and appearance of the proposal would significantly harm the appearance of the area; therefore prior approval is required and hereby refused."
  ],
